#: ../../.opencode/commands/roadmap-review.md:4
msgid "Route this triage request to the `roadmap-reviewer` agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/roadmap-review.md:6
msgid ""
"The agent loads the `roadmap-review` and `spec-composition` skills, "
"surveys the workspace (`hero size --check`, `hero_warnings`, `hero_list`,"
" `hero_search`), prioritizes findings, walks them one at a time, and "
"executes the chosen resolution CLI on confirm. Sizing is the only active "
"lens in v1; horizons / releases / sprint-shape are refused with a "
"scaffolded phrase."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/roadmap-review.md:13
msgid ""
"If `$ARGUMENTS` is non-empty, treat it as a focus slug — the agent should"
" scope its survey and triage to that one spec instead of the whole "
"corpus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/roadmap-review.md:17
msgid "Focus: $ARGUMENTS"
msgstr ""

